  // Canvas begins near-black. The faint noise spans the ENTIRE colour
  // spectrum equally — blues, greens, everything — at low luminance.
  // Nothing is pre-painted and no hue is privileged. Warmth/structure
  // emerges only through SELECTION (what gets noticed against the dark and
  // held), never through a biased substrate. This keeps the raw ingredients
  // free so that complex, any-colour art can evolve by selection.

  // Dark base colours — the canvas begins in near-darkness (neutral, no tint)
  const DARK_BASE=[
    '#080810','#09090f','#0a0a12','#0b0b14','#0c0c16',
    '#08080e','#0a0910','#0c0b14','#0e0d16','#0d0c18',
  ];

